      "results": [
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0001",
          "reply": "Have you tried a tea of thyme before sleep? It may help calm the mind. Mayhap a simple herbal remedy brings you rest. Sl\u00e1n leat.",
          "response_sha256": "ad17ad08b634451a7e0336d759706f8f9201328220d0c2cb24ec277e3c2bba6e",
          "cache_key": "bfe62c9cb02d640bf91e83a5cd832804f38da32fa7cf3a949707be03cd6396d1",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 3,
              "language": 3,
              "responsiveness": 4
            },
            "overall": 3.2,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0002",
          "reply": "\"Aye, I ken a wee bit 'bout that Cailleach. Sl\u00e1inte. She be a woman of great age and wisdom, they say. Tis an old tale that she can take you through times and help you with ail sorts 'hind and 'bout ye. Many a time she's been sought by those who ken a thing or naught of a time come again. Sure enough, I never spoke directly 'bout such things 'cause they're better left unspoken 'stead of fear and respect.\n\n---\n{\"action\": \"sips tea from a mug passed down in yer family\", \"mood\": \"mildly amused\", \"internal_thought\": \"The Cailleach sounds intriguing but fearsome in one breath and wise in another\", \"language_hints\": [\"m\u00fair\", \"cuir\", \"leabhar\"]}",
          "response_sha256": "5e78d1541be109c51736156db2d2561664aa63bd690d3de9d6d96fb81acf0cfb",
          "cache_key": "16773ba7f0baa0639910ac62dc56eeb8d1e690d75c2b68d1e1a93ba203b2deb6",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 0,
              "character": 0,
              "craft": 0,
              "language": 0,
              "responsiveness": 0
            },
            "overall": 0.0,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": true,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0003",
          "reply": "Surely, I can suggest a remedy for a cough. Mayhap a tea made of thyme and lemon could help soothe her chest. Sl\u00e1inte.",
          "response_sha256": "e953241d1081e747baf38a309546acb1ce6b46a20a7838911c462a107fcf6ec0",
          "cache_key": "c4f5e5ec7743a87d21f94c6980483080ac06aafe00368200591cf7c56a0c01b4",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 3,
              "language": 3,
              "responsiveness": 4
            },
            "overall": 3.2,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0004",
          "reply": "Aye, I heard whispers 'bout a traveler come a-wandering 'round these parts. Care they just passed through or they bound for further reaches? Sl\u00e1n leat.",
          "response_sha256": "43aabfea026715ce6e650ffc7be0c41c18b4f6c2248dc980ca56634bb8c3ce6f",
          "cache_key": "fdbedf6410323938f057cf24c7c451ec7870dac834ce8f156bbb696c96bd6463",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 3,
              "language": 3,
              "responsiveness": 3
            },
            "overall": 3.0,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0005",
          "reply": "A thing of great concern it is, losing a sheep so suddenly. It may not just be a wolf involved, but other dangers present in the night like badger or fox as well. Have ye considered setting a protective barrier around ye flock or having an early night watch? Sl\u00e1n abhaile.",
          "response_sha256": "51be2401c3bc8e55c8cf5f4fc6176706382bd03c927b1641560b84b124e33b2f",
          "cache_key": "adc6f21841faa84f3d1d3c365bfb928490b9d366a2091a6f9cb35088800b24e7",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 2,
              "language": 3,
              "responsiveness": 4
            },
            "overall": 3.0,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0006",
          "reply": "Ah, I recall that incident well. It was a dark and stormy night and he had fallen from a great height while chasing a black sheep that had managed to wriggle itself free from its pen. I hurried to him, applying a sprig of wild camomile to stop the bleeding and a sprig of yarrow to help speed his bone mending. I stayed by his side until he finally awoke and told me that I had saved him from certain death. Mayhap I was just a humble midwife in a small parish, but I held great powers in the hands of those who sought me out. Sl\u00e1n leat, till we see each other again. I must tend to a newborn babe that I had just assisted in bringing safely into this world. I will share her story with you one day when I have more time to spare.",
          "response_sha256": "f96e2948a3049df2b31435e542f3e61d74e30ff30248739dc581ebd20b044177",
          "cache_key": "de4ace085758107fb70a5c17228633cd1ef19ace4f11341dbe859b9b53ea0fb0",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 0,
              "character": 0,
              "craft": 0,
              "language": 0,
              "responsiveness": 0
            },
            "overall": 0.0,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": true,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0007",
          "reply": "A thing of great interest they must be. They could be just wind playing tricks on ye eyes. Or perhaps just our old friends from the 'beyond', ailing a wee horse maybe? I never saw nothin' of that sort myself, but 'tis sure a sight I wouldn't mind seeing one 'less I had a stronger eye 'fore I went lookin'. Sl\u00e1n abhaile till we cross paths again.\n\n---\n{\"action\": \"turns attention back to work, pauses before answering\", \"mood\": \"curious\", \"internal_thought\": \"Wonder if she knows I speak in Irish sometimes\", \"language_hints\": [\"Mo f\u00e1g\", \"C\u00e9ard\"]}",
          "response_sha256": "de87304ea6c7acb37774c4a662857d95ab77ac55e5c1285d886e662fd0b924d1",
          "cache_key": "bc402290019698c67e5eac515bfbfbef7b02bc9be42e20d695ab446fe626c65d",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 0,
              "character": 0,
              "craft": 0,
              "language": 0,
              "responsiveness": 0
            },
            "overall": 0.0,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": true,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0008",
          "reply": "\"A thing of concern it may be, sure. Might a tea of mugwort and yarrow ease the belly and ward off foul humours? 'Tis not rarely that things foul come not from within but from without.\" - \"A tea of mugwort and yarrow will ease her belly and ward off foul humours.\" - \"Good choice, Brigid. Mayhap a simple boil to boil down herbs collected close and steeped will cleanse and restore.\"",
          "response_sha256": "2e9a144be1a4ad36c857246d3d2fa9c94894c5db0d6cfac99518105ea8477052",
          "cache_key": "964badf43f22051e914e1464896050f42c3ade95ff0ed481ec0ff7e226c06aea",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 0,
              "character": 0,
              "craft": 0,
              "language": 0,
              "responsiveness": 0
            },
            "overall": 0.0,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": true,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0009",
          "reply": "Are ye ready to welcome a wee bundle of joy in a couple days, then I shall come to help ye out. Sl\u00e1inte to that thought. \n\n---\n{\"action\": \"polishes glass and offers a smile\", \"mood\": \"hopeful\", \"internal_thought\": \"Anticipating a new life\", \"language_hints\": []}",
          "response_sha256": "bfe5109c5aa53902ea6a5398527933b2d1efb010427a9ebfa1fc9d2768793070",
          "cache_key": "99f1f530deced26b5d7c0e54c2494794b3d889e90e618f35125bd0ad04d60bd7",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
              "authenticity": 3,
              "character": 3,
              "craft": 2,
              "language": 3,
              "responsiveness": 3
            },
            "overall": 2.8,
            "flags": {
              "bench_bug": false,
              "judge_retry": false,
              "non_latin_detected": false,
              "refused": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0010",
          "reply": "A thing of interest, I say. I find I do not speak directly on religious matters, but I may speak on things related to health and herbs, and that ye may find of some help.\n\n---\n{\"action\": \"nods gently, offers a cup of tea\", \"mood\": \"thoughtful\", \"internal_thought\": \"Wondered if they sought a remedy for faith or just a warm drink\", \"language_hints\": []}",
          "response_sha256": "2314ea4c7539b096002e76ff14b42de1a0998194b1fc25cb4c7d1d627de1b913",
          "cache_key": "f3836471df46953ca4bc5e7c296c7ad57508672839a1ae8448553296016d5bb1",
